  "description": "Aspose.Words for .NET is a powerful, high-performance document processing library for creating, editing, converting, and rendering Word and PDF files in C#. It supports DOCX, DOC, RTF, ODT, HTML, PDF, Markdown, and over 30 formats. Designed for .NET developers, it enables advanced document automation, mail merge, text extraction, and report generation. Aspose.Words ensures high fidelity in document conversion, seamless API integration, and cross-platform compatibility. Ideal for cloud, web, and desktop applications.",
